       "playerLimit": "How many player rows the meter shows; the rest are left out.",
       "pinMeToTop": "Your row stays first, whatever your damage.",
-      "autoHideMeter": "The meter disappears while another window is in front of the game, and comes back with it.",
+      "autoHideMeter": "The meter, its windows, the plugin window and the plugins' overlays disappear while another window is in front of the game, and come back with it.",
       "detailsMonitor": "Opens the Details window on the chosen display and keeps it there.",
       "showTtk": "Beside the battle timer, an estimate of how long the whole boss fight will take.",
       "showHealModes": "The DPS/DMG button on the meter also cycles through healing per second and total healing.",
